      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "\"The Sole Survivor? No, I mean the Soul Stone!\"\r\nDeath is a constant, looming threat in this harsh world, and running back to your gravestone after a Creeper explosion is a massive waste of industrial uptime. This gem is your ultimate weapon against the fear of mortality. It actively anchors your life force to the physical realm, stitching your flesh and spirit back together in real-time.\n\nFunctionally, this stone acts as a hyper-accelerated healing matrix. When activated, it will rapidly and continuously restore your health, effectively making you unkillable by conventional, non-lethal damage. You no longer need to cower in fear of taking a few hits—wade into the fray and let your soul do the healing!",
